<topic template="Default" status="Under Construction" modified="2025-04-09T08:43:18.049-04:00" lasteditedby="rbwinst" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title translate="true">CTP: GWE Constant Temperature Package</title>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1"><text styleclass="Heading1" translate="true">CTP: GWE Constant Temperature Package</text></para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">The</text><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true"> CTP: GWE Constant Temperature Package</text><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> pane is used to activate the Constant Temperature package. It is on the </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="MODFLOW_Packages_Dialog_Box" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">MODFLOW Packages and Programs</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> dialog box under </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="Groundwater-Transport" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">Groundwater Transport|</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> | </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="GWE-Groundwater-Energy-Transp2" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">Groundwater Energy Transport Process</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">&quot;Multipliers&quot; can be used with CTP boundaries. Multipliers will be used if the &quot;</text><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true">Use Multiplier</text><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">&quot; checkbox is checked.. Ordinarily, multipliers are not needed. If multipliers are used, the temperature is multiplied by the value of the multiplier. One use for multipliers might be when the temperatures are defined using a </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="Time_Series_Dialog_Box" styleclass="Normal" translate="true">time-series</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> and it is desired to multiply the temperature values in the time series by a different amount at different locations.</text></para>
  </body>
</topic>
